# The sync server that release builds use: the Convex production deployment.
#
# Nothing here is secret. The URL ships inside every app build and shows up in the app's network
# traffic, so committing it to a public repo exposes nothing new. Knowing it lets someone call the
# backend's functions, but each function checks who's signed in and only touches that account's data.
# The actual secrets (the keys Convex Auth signs sign-ins with) live on the Convex deployment, not in a file.
#
# Don't add secrets to this file: everything prefixed VITE_ ends up in the app's JavaScript.
VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://dynamic-tapir-973.convex.cloud
